<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Swiss stocks.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Swiss stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued American-style call warrants on two single Swiss stocks.</p>
<p>There are seven million warrants on registered shares of Ciba Special Chemical and six million on registered shares of Clariant AG</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 22.MAY.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	21.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE     ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CIBA	  150 CHF    1.50 CHF   22.22 PCT    9 TIMES</p>
<p> CLARIANT    900 CHF    2.00 CHF   20.05 PCT    8.33 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
